{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bx9YfnZ7Jh1792042147.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>外圍跌勢持續，港股一度失守兩萬二大關。</p><p></p><p>恒指低開242點後，一度急挫逾400點，下試21,900點水平，之後跌幅收窄。</p><p></p><p>科網股普遍向下，騰訊及阿里巴巴跌百分之1，百度跌百分之2，不過聯想集團及網易升百分之4。黃金相關股份也有追捧，老鋪黃金升百分之4。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:31:28.998593+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T05:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T23:36:10.625672+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T06:24:36.413560+00:00","content_hash":"c33b2c832af5e789033da9efd06ec86886347ca9526211978aea1148b275564d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:31:28.998593+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}